{"seq":3,"slug":"beyond-fourier-wavelets","title":"超越傅里叶：小波","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/practice/beyond-fourier-wavelets","wordCount":1726,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"超越傅里叶-小波\">超越傅里叶：小波</h1><p>傅里叶变换有一个与生俱来的盲点：它能告诉你一段信号里有哪些频率，却说不清每个频率<strong>在什么时候</strong>出现。对一段稳定的纯音这无所谓，但对一段会变调的音乐、一次突发的地震、一张有锐利边缘的图像，「频率随时间/空间变化」恰恰是最关键的信息，而傅里叶把它彻底抹平了。前一篇 <a href=\"spectral-analysis\">谱分析与窗</a> 里的短时傅里叶变换（STFT）想用滑动窗补救，却撞上了固定窗长锁死分辨率的硬墙。这一篇诚实地交代傅里叶的边界，并介绍接棒的工具——小波分析，为整个 hub 收尾，也为读者打开下一片天地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>傅里叶的根本局限来自它的基函数：复指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{i\\omega t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">iω</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在整条时间轴上无限延伸、振幅恒定，频率完美确定的代价是时间完全弥散——它「无处不在」，所以无法定位「何时」。小波换了一组基：<strong>小波</strong>是一个能量集中在局部、会衰减归零的小波包，通过平移（管「何时」）和伸缩（管「何频」）生成一整族基函数，从而能同时回答时间和频率两个问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;傅里叶基: e^(iωt)&lt;br/&gt;频率确定, 时间弥散&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;只知有何频率&lt;br/&gt;不知何时出现&quot;]&#10;  C[&quot;STFT: 固定窗 × 傅里叶&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;窗长锁死时频分辨率&lt;br/&gt;(海森堡)&quot;]&#10;  E[&quot;小波基: 平移+伸缩的小波&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;多分辨率分析&lt;br/&gt;高频用短窗, 低频用长窗&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;同时定位 时间 与 频率&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"傅里叶基: e^(iωt)&lt;br/&gt;频率确定, 时间弥散\"] --&gt; B[\"只知有何频率&lt;br/&gt;不知何时出现\"]\n  C[\"STFT: 固定窗 × 傅里叶\"] --&gt; D[\"窗长锁死时频分辨率&lt;br/&gt;(海森堡)\"]\n  E[\"小波基: 平移+伸缩的小波\"] --&gt; F[\"多分辨率分析&lt;br/&gt;高频用短窗, 低频用长窗\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"同时定位 时间 与 频率\"]\n  B --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"海森堡不确定性-无法回避的硬约束\">海森堡不确定性：无法回避的硬约束</h2><p>为什么不能既精确知道频率又精确知道时间？这不是技术不够，而是数学的铁律。由 <a href=\"../transforms/transform-properties\">变换性质</a> 里的尺度性质可知，信号在时域的展宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 与频域的展宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span></span></span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ω</mi><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t \\cdot \\Delta\\omega \\geq \\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>时间定位越精确（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 越小），频率就越模糊（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span></span></span> 越大），反之亦然——这与量子力学里位置-动量不确定性是同一个数学事实。取等号（最优局部化）的恰是高斯信号，这呼应了 <a href=\"../transforms/continuous-fourier-transform\">连续傅里叶变换</a> 里「高斯↔高斯」的特殊地位。</p>\n<p>STFT 与小波都受这条铁律约束，谁也违反不了。区别在于<strong>如何分配</strong>这份固定的时频「预算」：STFT 用一个固定窗，对所有频率一视同仁；小波则更聪明——它对高频用短窗（时间分辨率高，因为高频变化快需要看得细），对低频用长窗（频率分辨率高，因为低频需要长时间才看得准）。这种「按频率自适应分配分辨率」就是<strong>多分辨率分析</strong>，更贴合真实信号的结构。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时频分辨率分配</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>傅里叶</td>\n<td>频率完美，时间为零</td>\n<td>平稳信号、纯频率分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>STFT</td>\n<td>固定窗，各频率一致</td>\n<td>缓变的时变信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小波</td>\n<td>高频短窗、低频长窗（自适应）</td>\n<td>瞬态、突变、多尺度信号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小波变换-平移与伸缩\">小波变换：平移与伸缩</h2><p>连续小波变换把信号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与一族由母小波 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span></span> 经平移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>、伸缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 生成的小波做内积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>ψ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W(a,b) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{|a|}}\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} x(t)\\,\\psi\\!\\left(\\frac{t-b}{a}\\right) dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.58em;vertical-align:-1.13em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.175em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.13em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4143em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9703em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 小对应高频（小波被压窄）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 大对应低频（小波被拉宽），平移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 扫过时间轴。这仍然是 <a href=\"../foundations/orthogonal-basis\">正交基与投影</a> 里「把信号投影到一组基上」的老思想——只是基从全局的复指数换成了局部的小波。常见母小波各有性格：Haar 小波最简单（方波状，适合突变检测）、Daubechies 小波紧支撑且光滑（图像压缩常用）、Morlet 小波（高斯调制正弦，时频分析常用）。离散小波变换还有一个类似 <a href=\"fft-algorithm\">FFT 快速算法</a> 的快速算法（Mallat 金字塔），复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，比 FFT 还快一个对数因子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小波的实战地盘\">小波的实战地盘</h2><p>小波最响亮的战绩是图像压缩标准 <strong>JPEG 2000</strong>：它用离散小波变换取代了 JPEG 的分块 DCT，因而避免了 <a href=\"fourier-applications\">信号与图像应用</a> 里那种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\times8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 块边界的块效应，在高压缩比下画质更平滑，还天然支持「渐进式」由模糊到清晰的传输。小波也是去噪利器——把信号做小波变换后，噪声散布在大量小系数里、而真实信号集中在少数大系数上，做一次「阈值收缩」（砍掉小系数）再反变换，就能在保住边缘的同时去掉噪声，这是傅里叶域硬性低通做不到的（低通会同时模糊边缘）。此外小波在金融时间序列的多尺度分析、地震信号的瞬态检测、引力波探测的信号匹配中都有应用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>小波相对傅里叶的优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JPEG 2000 图像压缩</td>\n<td>无块效应，支持渐进传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号去噪</td>\n<td>阈值收缩保边缘，优于低通滤波</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瞬态/突变检测</td>\n<td>局部化基天然适合捕捉突变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多尺度分析</td>\n<td>同时看「大趋势」和「局部细节」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"不是替代-而是各擅其场\">不是替代，而是各擅其场</h2><p>要避免一个误解：小波不是来「取代」傅里叶的。对平稳信号、对需要精确频率的场合（音频均衡、通信调制、振动诊断里的稳态分析），傅里叶依然是最自然、最高效的工具，它的全局频率视角无可替代。小波的价值在于补上傅里叶的盲区——非平稳、瞬态、多尺度、需要时间定位的场景。二者是互补的两套眼镜，不是新旧替代关系。更广的时频分析家族里还有 Gabor 变换、Wigner-Ville 分布、经验模态分解（EMD）、以及近年与深度学习结合的可学习滤波器组，傅里叶分析正是通往这整片天地的起点。本 hub 到此把你送到这片更广阔疆域的门口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>傅里叶的根本盲点：复指数全局延伸，知道有何频率却不知何时出现；STFT 用固定窗补救但分辨率被锁死。</li>\n<li>海森堡不确定性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ω</mi><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t\\cdot\\Delta\\omega\\geq\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是铁律，谁也违反不了；小波的聪明在于按频率自适应分配这份预算（高频短窗、低频长窗）。</li>\n<li>小波变换 = 把信号投影到由母小波平移+伸缩生成的局部基上，是正交投影思想的延续；有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的 Mallat 快速算法。</li>\n<li>实战：JPEG 2000 无块效应、小波阈值去噪保边缘、瞬态与多尺度分析，都是傅里叶域难做的。</li>\n<li>小波与傅里叶互补而非替代——平稳/精确频率用傅里叶，非平稳/瞬态/多尺度用小波；二者通向更广的时频分析天地。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：本篇接续 <a href=\"spectral-analysis\">谱分析与窗</a> 的 STFT 局限；不确定性溯源 <a href=\"../transforms/transform-properties\">变换性质</a> 与 <a href=\"../transforms/continuous-fourier-transform\">连续傅里叶变换</a>；投影思想见 <a href=\"../foundations/orthogonal-basis\">正交基与投影</a>；快速算法类比 <a href=\"../discrete/fft-algorithm\">FFT 快速算法</a>；JPEG 2000 对比 <a href=\"fourier-applications\">信号与图像应用</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：小波去噪的统计阈值理论见 <a href=\"../../probability-statistics/\">概率统计 (02)</a>；时频分析背后的复变工具见 <a href=\"../../complex-analysis/\">复分析 (20)</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"超越傅里叶：小波","id":"超越傅里叶-小波"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"海森堡不确定性：无法回避的硬约束","id":"海森堡不确定性-无法回避的硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小波变换：平移与伸缩","id":"小波变换-平移与伸缩"},{"level":2,"text":"小波的实战地盘","id":"小波的实战地盘"},{"level":2,"text":"不是替代，而是各擅其场","id":"不是替代-而是各擅其场"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"信号与图像应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/practice/fourier-applications"},"next":null}